sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Contractor
    actor P as Provider
    actor W as Field Worker
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    C->>API: POST /projects (work zone, dates)
    API->>DB: save project
    C->>API: POST /projects/{id}/requests (chosen providers)
    P->>API: POST /requests/{id}/quotes (price, notes)
    C->>API: POST /projects/{id}/confirm-provider
    API->>DB: quote accepted, others rejected, project active, 3 milestones
    C->>API: POST /projects/{id}/payments, then capture (PayPal Sandbox)
    P->>API: POST /projects/{id}/assignments (field worker)
    W->>API: POST attendance/check-in (site code + GPS, within 300 m)
    W->>API: POST /devices/{code}/verify (GPS, within 50 m)
    W->>API: POST /field-worker/projects/{id}/photos (before / during / after)
    P->>API: PATCH milestones, then POST submit-completion
    C->>API: POST /projects/{id}/complete or /request-changes
